	"回到村長身邊，聽聽星光與五個願望的傳說": "Return to the mayor and hear the tale of starlight and five wishes.",
	"微風送來一封沒有署名的信：『當五個願望在夜裡亮起，回家的道路就會出現。』": "A breeze brings an unsigned letter: “When five wishes shine at night, the road home will appear.”",
	"五個願望……是五顆星星嗎？還是五個等待幫助的人？": "Five wishes... five stars, or five people waiting for help?",
	"星光長老：你每幫助一位朋友，失落的小徑就亮起一段。不要急著追逐終點，沿途的溫柔才是森林真正的秘密。": "Elder Starlight: Every friend you help lights another part of the lost path. Do not rush toward the end; the kindness along the way is the forest’s secret.",
	"村長老維：你知道嗎？從前每一顆星星都代表一個願意守護他人的心願。": "Mayor: Long ago, each star represented a wish to protect someone else.",
	"村長老維：小兔子的勇氣、村民的花、鐵匠的燈，以及米米的笑容，都是星光留下的回音。": "Mayor: Bunny’s courage, the villager’s flower, the blacksmith’s lantern, and Mimi’s smile are echoes of starlight.",
