	"很久很久以前，夜空中掛著一條由星光鋪成的小徑，一路通往森林深處。": "Long, long ago, a path paved with starlight stretched across the night sky, leading deep into the forest.",
	"星光照亮了每一棵樹、每一朵花，讓森林裡的動物們永遠不會迷路。": "The starlight lit every tree and every flower, so the forest animals never lost their way.",
	"但某一天，最明亮的一顆星星碎片墜落到了森林裡……從那天起，小徑開始變得暗淡。": "But one day, the brightest star shard fell into the forest... From that day on, the path began to fade.",
	"這裡是……哪裡？我明明只是沿著山路走，怎麼會來到這片森林？": "Where am I...? I was just walking along a mountain road. How did I end up in this forest?",
	"好安靜的森林。等等……我好像聽見了細細的歌聲，是從樹林深處傳來的。": "Such a quiet forest. Wait... I think I hear a faint song, drifting from deep among the trees.",
	"夜色已深，提著燈的旅行者，你的冒險，就從這片星光森林開始了。": "The night is deep, lantern-bearing traveler. Your adventure begins in this starlit forest.",
	"小狐狸：我好像迷路了…但是森林的空氣好舒服喔。": "Fox: I think I'm lost... but the forest air feels so nice.",
	"小狐狸：聽說你幫小兔子找回了胡蘿蔔，你真是個好心的旅人呢！": "Fox: I heard you helped Bunny find the carrot. What a kind traveler you are!",
	"小狐狸：你也是被星光帶來的旅人嗎？我好像迷路了…回家的路不見了。": "Fox: Are you a traveler brought here by the starlight too? I'm lost... I can't find the way home.",
	"小狐狸：如果你看到一間有紅色屋頂的小木屋，記得告訴我喔。": "Fox: If you see a little wooden cabin with a red roof, please tell me!",
	"星光長老：森林已經漸漸恢復光亮了。往東邊的小路走，會看見一座熱鬧的村莊。": "Elder Starlight: The forest is slowly regaining its light. Follow the path east and you will find a lively village.",
	"星光長老：你願意幫助森林裡的每一位朋友，星光也看見了你的善意。": "Elder Starlight: You have helped every friend in this forest, and the starlight has seen your kindness.",
	"星光長老：很久以前，最亮的那顆星星碎片墜落在森林深處，守護著通往神殿的路。": "Elder Starlight: Long ago, the brightest star shard fell deep in the forest and has guarded the way to the shrine ever since.",
	"星光長老：森林之外還有人類的村莊，他們的燈火也需要被照亮。往東邊去吧。": "Elder Starlight: Beyond the forest lies a human village, and its lights need to be rekindled too. Head east.",
	"星光長老：年輕的旅人，星光不會回應陌生人的呼喚。": "Elder Starlight: Young traveler, the starlight does not answer the calls of strangers.",
	"星光長老：先去幫助森林裡需要幫忙的朋友吧，他們的感謝會成為照亮小徑的光。": "Elder Starlight: Go and help the friends in this forest who need you. Their gratitude will become the light that guides the path.",
	"松鼠松果：吱吱！聽說村子裡的鐵匠在找木頭呢，你要是有多的，就幫幫他吧！": "Pinecone: Squeak! I heard the village blacksmith is looking for wood. If you have some spare, please help him!",
	"松鼠松果：村子的廣場中央有個噴水池，夜裡水聲特別好聽喔。": "Pinecone: The village square has a fountain in the middle. Its splashing sounds lovely at night.",
	"松鼠松果：吱吱！你是新來的嗎？我藏了好多橡果，結果忘記藏在哪裡了！": "Pinecone: Squeak! Are you new here? I hid so many acorns and then forgot where I put them!",
	"松鼠松果：如果你看到橡果，記得告訴我喔。": "Pinecone: If you see any acorns, please let me know!",
	"精靈露露：夜晚的森林有很多小秘密喔。": "Fairy Lulu: The night forest holds many little secrets.",
	"精靈露露：按 I 可以打開背包，看看你身上有什麼吧。": "Fairy Lulu: Press I to open your inventory and see what you're carrying.",
	"精靈露露：湖面映出的星光，是在等待有人喚醒它們。": "Fairy Lulu: The starlight reflected on the lake is waiting for someone to awaken it.",
	"精靈露露：星光小徑的盡頭，據說連著一座古老的神殿，但只有在星光醒來時才會開啟。": "Fairy Lulu: At the end of the starlit path lies an ancient shrine, said to open only when the starlight awakens.",
	"村長老維：聽說你幫小女孩找回了燈籠，謝謝你。": "Mayor Laowei: I heard you helped the little girl find her lantern. Thank you.",
	"村長老維：這個村子需要更多像你這樣願意幫忙的人。": "Mayor Laowei: This village needs more people like you who are willing to help.",
	"村長老維：歡迎來到星光村。自從星光變暗後，村子的夜晚就特別冷清。": "Mayor Laowei: Welcome to Starlight Village. Ever since the starlight dimmed, our nights have been so lonely.",
	"村長老維：村裡的人都很善良，只是最近大家都有些擔心。你可以四處看看。": "Mayor Laowei: Everyone here is kind, but lately we've all been worried. Feel free to look around.",
	"旅店老闆娘小芽：孩子們都很喜歡你呢，夜裡的燈籠又亮起來了。": "Innkeeper Xiaoya: The children really like you. The lanterns are glowing again at night.",
	"旅店老闆娘小芽：今晚的房間還空著，住一晚再走吧，窗外的星星很漂亮。": "Innkeeper Xiaoya: We still have a room free tonight. Stay the night before you go, the stars outside are beautiful.",
	"旅店老闆娘小芽：今晚的房間還空著喔，住一晚再走吧，窗外的星星很漂亮。": "Innkeeper Xiaoya: We still have a room free tonight. Stay the night before you go, the stars outside are beautiful.",
	"旅行商人阿珂：我走遍了不少地方，聽說北方有座古老的星光神殿。": "Merchant Ake: I've travelled far and wide. I heard there is an ancient starlight shrine to the north.",
	"旅行商人阿珂：要是你找到了神殿的入口，記得告訴我，我想去看看。": "Merchant Ake: If you find the entrance to the shrine, tell me. I'd love to see it.",
	"守衛阿力：夜裡要注意安全喔，森林那邊偶爾會有奇怪的風聲。": "Guard Ali: Stay safe at night. Sometimes strange winds blow from the forest.",
	"守衛阿力：如果看到有人需要幫忙，就去幫一把吧，村子就是靠大家互相照應。": "Guard Ali: If you see someone who needs help, lend a hand. This village survives because we look out for each other.",
	"旁白：夜幕降臨，星光村的燈火一盞盞亮了起來。": "Narrator: Night falls, and the lights of Starlight Village glow one by one.",
	"守衛阿力：喔，來了新面孔？村長住在廣場北邊，有事可以去找他。": "Guard Ali: Oh, a new face? The mayor lives north of the square. Go see him if you need anything.",
	"守衛阿力：鐵匠石頭伯最近在找木頭，你可以去看看他需要什麼幫忙。": "Guard Ali: Blacksmith Shitou has been looking for wood lately. Go see what he needs.",
	"旅行者：這裡就是星光森林……夜裡的光好柔和。": "Traveler: So this is the Starlight Forest... the light at night is so gentle.",
	"旁白：去和森林裡的居民打個招呼吧，他們或許知道回家的路。": "Narrator: Go say hello to the forest residents. They may know the way home.",
	"小兔子：嗚嗚…我的胡蘿蔔不見了。今天早上我明明把它放在洞口的。": "Bunny: Waaah... my carrot is gone. I'm sure I left it by the burrow this morning.",
	"小兔子：你可以幫我在森林裡找找看嗎？我好害怕它被大風吹走了…": "Bunny: Could you look for it in the forest? I'm so scared the wind blew it away...",
	"小兔子：胡蘿蔔還沒找到嗎？我記得它是橘色的，可能掉在森林的某個角落喔。": "Bunny: Still haven't found the carrot? It's orange, and it may have fallen somewhere in the forest.",
	"小兔子：啊！是我的胡蘿蔔！你真的找到了！": "Bunny: Oh! That's my carrot! You really found it!",
	"小兔子：謝謝你！這個星星碎片是我在洞穴旁撿到的，送給你當作謝禮吧。": "Bunny: Thank you! I found this star shard by the cave. Please take it as a thank-you gift.",
	"小兔子：有你在，森林變得更安心了呢。": "Bunny: With you around, the forest feels much safer.",
	"村民：唉，昨晚的風好大，花圃裡的花都被吹散了。": "Villager: Sigh, the wind was so strong last night. The flowers in the garden were all blown away.",
	"村民：如果你能找到一朵花，我會好好謝謝你。草地上應該還有幾朵呢。": "Villager: If you can find one flower, I'll be truly grateful. There should still be a few out on the grass.",
	"村民：花朵還沒找到嗎？小路邊和湖邊都可以找找看。": "Villager: Still no flower? Try along the path and by the lake.",
	"村民：哇，這朵花好漂亮！謝謝你，我正好需要它來裝飾村子的入口。": "Villager: Wow, what a lovely flower! Thank you, I needed it to decorate the village entrance.",
	"村民：這些蘑菇是我今早採的，拿去吃吧，走路會更有力氣喔。": "Villager: I picked these mushrooms this morning. Take them, they'll give you more energy for walking.",
	"村民：花圃又恢復漂亮了，大家都很感謝你。": "Villager: The garden is beautiful again, and everyone is grateful to you.",
	"鐵匠石頭伯：嘿，旅人！我正缺一根木材來修補燈籠的支架。": "Blacksmith Shitou: Hey, traveler! I'm short one piece of wood to repair a lantern frame.",
	"鐵匠石頭伯：森林裡應該有幾根掉落的木頭，幫我找一根回來，我就做一盞燈籠報答你。": "Blacksmith Shitou: There should be some fallen wood in the forest. Bring me one and I'll make you a lantern as thanks.",
	"鐵匠石頭伯：木頭還沒找到嗎？森林裡地上那些棕色的木段都可以。": "Blacksmith Shitou: Still no wood? Any of those brown logs lying in the forest will do.",
	"鐵匠石頭伯：好木頭！說到做到，這盞燈籠送你。": "Blacksmith Shitou: Good wood! As promised, this lantern is yours.",
	"鐵匠石頭伯：夜裡走路得有光才行，但它也能照亮別人的路。": "Blacksmith Shitou: You need light to walk at night, and this one can light the way for others too.",
	"鐵匠石頭伯：燈籠還亮著嗎？那就好。我的爐火也還沒熄呢。": "Blacksmith Shitou: Is the lantern still glowing? Good. My forge hasn't gone out either.",
	"小女孩米米：嗚…我的燈籠被風吹熄了，爸爸說要等鐵匠伯伯有空才能修。": "Mimi: Waaah... my lantern blew out. Daddy says I have to wait until the blacksmith has time to fix it.",
	"小女孩米米：你好！我的燈籠被風吹熄了…如果你有燈籠，可以借我照一下路嗎？": "Mimi: Hi! My lantern blew out... If you have a lantern, could I borrow it to light my way?",
	"小女孩米米：燈籠…還沒有嗎？鐵匠伯伯那邊應該有喔。": "Mimi: The lantern... you don't have one yet? The blacksmith should have one.",
	"小女孩米米：哇！燈籠又亮起來了！謝謝你，這些野莓是我早上採的，送給你！": "Mimi: Wow! The lantern is glowing again! Thank you! I picked these wild berries this morning, please have them!",
	"小女孩米米：晚上的廣場現在好亮喔，我都不怕了。": "Mimi: The square is so bright at night now. I'm not scared anymore.",
